description:
This soliciation is to provide turn-key services for a design/build project to construct an addition to the Maloney Canine Training Center located at the James J. Rowley Training Center in Laurel, MD.&nbsp; This new footprint will be located on the southeast corner of the existing Maloney Canine building. The venue shall include several key spaces that will enable the care and treatment of the K9 occupants.&nbsp; The dimension of the base design will be 71&rsquo;-6&rdquo; x 34&rsquo;-8&rdquo; [2,479 square feet].&nbsp;&nbsp; 

The period of performance is 410 calendar days from Notice to Proceed.&nbsp; 

This is a small business set aside.&nbsp;
